GAL16V8
SIMPLE1

Clk  A    B    C    D    E    F    G    H    GND
/OE  Y0   Y1   Y2   Y3   Y4   Y5   Y6   Y7   VCC

; Simple mode: no registers, no tristate, no inputs on pins 15/16
Y0 = A * B
Y1 = A + B
/Y2 = A & !B # !A & B
Y3 = C * D * E * F * G * H * Clk * OE
Y4 = A + B + C + D + E + F + G + H
Y5 = GND
Y6 = VCC

DESCRIPTION
Pin 11 is declared negated and used without the slash.  Y7 is never used.
